<!doctype html><html lang="en" class="h-full"><head><meta charset="UTF-8"><meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0"><meta name="color-scheme" content="light dark"><meta http-equiv="X-Content-Type-Options" content="nosniff"><meta http-equiv="Referrer-Policy" content="strict-origin-when-cross-origin"><title>Installation — templ-components</title><meta name="description" content="How to install the library"><link rel="canonical" href="https://templcomponents.lars.software/getting-started/installation"><script type="application/ld+json">{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"SoftwareApplication","applicationCategory":"DeveloperApplication","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"LarsArtmann","url":"https://larsartmann.com/"},"description":"A pure Tailwind CSS v4 component library for Go's templ engine with first-class HTMX integration. No DaisyUI, no Node.js, no framework lock-in.","license":"https://opensource.org/licenses/MIT","name":"templ-components","offers":{"@type":"Offer","price":"0","priceCurrency":"USD"},"operatingSystem":"Go","programmingLanguage":"Go","url":"https://templcomponents.lars.software"}</script><link rel="icon" href="/favicon.svg"><meta name="theme-color" content="#2563eb" media="(prefers-color-scheme: light)"><meta name="theme-color" content="#2563eb" media="(prefers-color-scheme: dark)"><meta property="og:title" content="Installation — templ-components"><meta property="og:description" content="How to install the library"><meta property="og:type" content="website"><meta property="og:image" content="https://templcomponents.lars.software/og/getting-started/installation.png"><meta property="og:locale" content="en"><meta name="twitter:card" content="summary_large_image"><meta name="twitter:title" content="Installation — templ-components"><meta name="twitter:description" content="How to install the library"><meta name="twitter:image" content="https://templcomponents.lars.software/og/getting-started/installation.png"><script nonce="golden-test-nonce">
			(function() {
				var theme;
				try { theme = localStorage.getItem('theme'); } catch(e) {}
				var prefersDark = window.matchMedia('(prefers-color-scheme: dark)').matches;
				var isDark = theme === 'dark' || (!theme && prefersDark);
				if (isDark) {
					document.documentElement.classList.add('dark');
				}
				document.documentElement.style.colorScheme = isDark ? 'dark' : 'light';
			})();
		</script><link rel="stylesheet" href="/assets/app.css"><link rel="manifest" href="/manifest.json"><link rel="stylesheet" href="/assets/css/chroma.css"><link rel="preload" href="/assets/fonts/space-grotesk-latin-400-normal.woff2" as="font" type="font/woff2" crossorigin="anonymous"><link rel="preload" href="/assets/fonts/space-grotesk-latin-700-normal.woff2" as="font" type="font/woff2" crossorigin="anonymous"><link rel="preload" href="/assets/fonts/jetbrains-mono-latin-400-normal.woff2" as="font" type="font/woff2" crossorigin="anonymous"><script src="/assets/js/docs.js" defer></script><script src="/assets/js/copy-code.js" defer></script><script src="/assets/js/theme-sync.js" defer></script><script src="/assets/js/header.js" defer></script><script src="/assets/js/search.js" defer></script><script src="/assets/js/animations.js" defer></script><script src="/assets/js/newsletter.js" defer></script></head><body class="antialiased bg-bg-primary font-sans leading-relaxed text-text-secondary"><a href="#main-content" class="dark:focus:bg-blue-500 dark:focus:ring-blue-400 dark:focus:ring-offset-gray-900 focus:absolute focus:bg-blue-600 focus:not-sr-only focus:outline-hidden focus:px-4 focus:py-2 focus:ring-2 focus:ring-blue-500 focus:ring-offset-2 focus:rounded-md focus:shadow-lg focus:start-2 focus:text-white focus:top-2 focus:z-50 sr-only">Skip to content</a> <main id="main-content" tabindex="-1" class="flex-1"><header role="banner"><nav class="backdrop-blur-xl bg-bg-primary/60 border-b border-border fixed left-0 right-0 top-0 z-50" aria-label="Main navigation"><div class="flex h-16 items-center justify-between max-w-7xl mx-auto px-6"><a href="/" class="flex gap-2.5 group items-center no-underline"><svg class="duration-200 group-hover:rotate-12 transition-transform" width="28" height="28" viewBox="0 0 28 28" fill="none" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" role="img" aria-label="templ-components logo"><rect width="28" height="28" rx="6" class="fill-accent"></rect> <path d="M10 9L5 14l5 5M18 9l5 5-5 5M15.5 7l-3 14" stroke="white" stroke-width="1.8" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"></path></svg><span class="font-semibold text-base text-text-primary tracking-tight">templ-components</span></a> <button class="bg-transparent border-none cursor-pointer hover:text-text-primary lg:hidden nav-toggle p-1 text-text-muted transition-colors" id="nav-toggle" aria-label="Toggle navigation" aria-expanded="false" aria-controls="nav-links"><span class="menu-icon"><svg class="h-[22px] w-[22px]" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke-width="1.5" stroke="currentColor" aria-hidden="true"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="M3.75 6.75h16.5M3.75 12h16.5m-16.5 5.25h16.5"></path></svg></span> <span class="close-icon hidden"><svg class="h-[22px] w-[22px]" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke-width="1.5" stroke="currentColor" aria-hidden="true"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="M6 18L18 6M6 6l12 12"></path></svg></span></button><div class="[&.open]:max-sm:flex flex gap-5 items-center max-sm:absolute max-sm:backdrop-blur-[40px] max-sm:bg-bg-primary max-sm:border-b max-sm:border-border max-sm:flex-col max-sm:gap-4 max-sm:hidden max-sm:inset-x-0 max-sm:p-6 max-sm:top-16 nav-links" id="nav-links"><div class="doc-search-wrap"><label class="sr-only" for="doc-search-input">Search documentation</label> <input type="search" id="doc-search-input" class="doc-search max-sm:w-full" placeholder="Search docs…" autocomplete="off" spellcheck="false" role="combobox" aria-expanded="false" aria-controls="doc-search-results" aria-autocomplete="list"><div class="doc-search-results hidden" id="doc-search-results" role="listbox" aria-label="Search results"></div></div><button type="button" class="dark:hover:bg-gray-800 dark:hover:text-gray-300 dark:text-gray-500 hover:bg-gray-100 hover:text-gray-500 motion-reduce:duration-0 motion-reduce:transition-none p-2 rounded-md text-gray-400 transition-colors" data-theme-toggle role="switch" aria-checked="false" aria-label="Toggle light/dark mode"><svg class="dark:hidden h-5 w-5" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke-width="1.5" stroke="currentColor" aria-hidden="true"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="M21.752 15.002A9.718 9.718 0 0118 15.75c-5.385 0-9.75-4.365-9.75-9.75 0-1.33.266-2.597.748-3.752A9.753 9.753 0 003 11.25C3 16.635 7.365 21 12.75 21a9.753 9.753 0 009.002-5.998z"></path></svg><svg class="dark:block h-5 hidden w-5" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke-width="1.5" stroke="currentColor" aria-hidden="true"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="M12 3v2.25m6.364.386l-1.591 1.591M21 12h-2.25m-.386 6.364l-1.591-1.591M12 18.75V21m-4.773-4.227l-1.591 1.591M5.25 12H3m4.227-4.773L5.636 5.636M15.75 12a3.75 3.75 0 11-7.5 0 3.75 3.75 0 017.5 0z"></path></svg></button> <script nonce="golden-test-nonce">
			(function() {
				var html = document.documentElement;

				function syncToggleAria(btn) {
					if (btn) btn.setAttribute('aria-checked', String(html.classList.contains('dark')));
				}

				// Always sync aria-checked, even after htmx swap re-injects a button
				// with the hardcoded aria-checked="false". This runs on every render;
				// the click listener below is guarded so it only attaches once.
				document.querySelectorAll('[data-theme-toggle]').forEach(syncToggleAria);

				if (!window.tcThemeToggleAttached) {
					window.tcThemeToggleAttached = true;

					document.addEventListener('click', function(e) {
					var btn = e.target.closest('[data-theme-toggle]');
					if (!btn) return;
					var isDark = html.classList.contains('dark');
					if (isDark) {
						html.classList.remove('dark');
						try { localStorage.setItem('theme', 'light'); } catch(e) {}
					} else {
						html.classList.add('dark');
						try { localStorage.setItem('theme', 'dark'); } catch(e) {}
					}
					html.style.colorScheme = isDark ? 'light' : 'dark';
					document.querySelectorAll('[data-theme-toggle]').forEach(syncToggleAria);
					});
				}
			})();
		</script><a href="/getting-started/installation" class="duration-150 hover:text-text-primary nav-link no-underline text-sm text-text-secondary transition-colors">Docs</a> <a href="https://github.com/larsartmann/templ-components" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="duration-150 flex gap-1.5 hover:text-text-primary items-center nav-link no-underline text-sm text-text-secondary transition-colors"><span class="text-text-muted"><svg class="h-4 w-4" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="currentColor" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M12 0c-6.626 0-12 5.373-12 12 0 5.302 3.438 9.8 8.207 11.387.599.111.793-.261.793-.577v-2.234c-3.338.726-4.033-1.416-4.033-1.416-.546-1.387-1.333-1.756-1.333-1.756-1.089-.745.083-.729.083-.729 1.205.084 1.839 1.237 1.839 1.237 1.07 1.834 2.807 1.304 3.492.997.107-.775.418-1.305.762-1.604-2.665-.305-5.467-1.334-5.467-5.931 0-1.311.469-2.381 1.236-3.221-.124-.303-.535-1.524.117-3.176 0 0 1.008-.322 3.301 1.23.957-.266 1.983-.399 3.003-.404 1.02.005 2.047.138 3.006.404 2.291-1.552 3.297-1.23 3.297-1.23.653 1.653.242 2.874.118 3.176.77.84 1.235 1.911 1.235 3.221 0 4.609-2.807 5.624-5.479 5.921.43.372.823 1.102.823 2.222v3.293c0 .319.192.694.801.576 4.765-1.589 8.199-6.086 8.199-11.386 0-6.627-5.373-12-12-12z"></path></svg></span> GitHub</a></div></div></nav></header> <div class="max-w-7xl mx-auto pb-16 pt-24 px-6"><div class="flex gap-10"><aside class="hidden lg:block shrink-0 w-56" aria-label="Documentation navigation"><nav class="docs-nav sticky top-24" aria-label="Documentation navigation"><div class="mb-6"><div class="font-mono mb-2 text-text-muted text-xs tracking-[0.2em] uppercase">Getting Started</div><ul class="space-y-1"><li><a href="/getting-started/installation" aria-current="page" class="docs-nav-active docs-nav-link">Installation</a></li><li><a href="/getting-started/quick-start" class="docs-nav-link">Quick Start</a></li></ul></div><div class="mb-6"><div class="font-mono mb-2 text-text-muted text-xs tracking-[0.2em] uppercase">Guides</div><ul class="space-y-1"><li><a href="/guides/theming" class="docs-nav-link">Theming</a></li><li><a href="/guides/dark-mode" class="docs-nav-link">Dark Mode</a></li><li><a href="/guides/htmx-integration" class="docs-nav-link">HTMX Integration</a></li><li><a href="/guides/transport-wiring" class="docs-nav-link">Transport Wiring</a></li><li><a href="/guides/accessibility" class="docs-nav-link">Accessibility</a></li><li><a href="/guides/csp-compliance" class="docs-nav-link">CSP Compliance</a></li><li><a href="/guides/invariants" class="docs-nav-link">Guarantees</a></li><li><a href="/guides/version-support" class="docs-nav-link">Version Support</a></li></ul></div><div class="mb-6"><div class="font-mono mb-2 text-text-muted text-xs tracking-[0.2em] uppercase">API Reference</div><ul class="space-y-1"><li><a href="/api-reference" class="docs-nav-link">Public API</a></li><li><a href="https://pkg.go.dev/github.com/larsartmann/templ-components" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="docs-nav-link flex gap-1.5 items-center">Full API on pkg.go.dev<svg class="h-3 w-3" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke-width="1.5" stroke="currentColor" aria-hidden="true"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="M13.5 6H5.25A2.25 2.25 0 003 8.25v10.5A2.25 2.25 0 005.25 21h10.5A2.25 2.25 0 0018 18.75V10.5m-10.5 6L21 3m0 0h-5.25M21 3v5.25"></path></svg></a></li></ul></div><div class="mb-6"><div class="font-mono mb-2 text-text-muted text-xs tracking-[0.2em] uppercase">Community</div><ul class="space-y-1"><li><a href="/changelog" class="docs-nav-link">Changelog</a></li><li><a href="/contributing" class="docs-nav-link">Contributing</a></li><li><a href="/related-projects" class="docs-nav-link">Related Projects</a></li></ul></div></nav></aside><article class="docs-content flex-1 max-w-3xl min-w-0"><h1 class="font-bold mb-2 text-3xl text-text-primary tracking-tight">Installation</h1><p class="mb-8 text-text-secondary">How to install the library</p><h2 id="requirements">Requirements</h2><p>Go 1.26+ with the templ CLI.</p><div class="code-block"><button type="button" class="code-copy">Copy</button><pre><code class="chroma">go get github.com/larsartmann/templ-components</code></pre></div><h3 id="tools">Tools</h3><p>Add the <code>templ</code> binary.</p><div class="border-border border-t flex gap-4 items-center justify-between mt-12 pt-6 text-sm"><span></span> <span></span></div><div class="flex gap-4 items-center justify-between mt-6 text-text-muted text-xs"><span>Last updated 2026-09-13</span> <a href="https://github.com/larsartmann/templ-components/edit/master/website/content/docs/getting-started/installation.md" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="duration-150 hover:text-text-primary transition-colors underline underline-offset-2">Edit this page</a></div></article><aside class="hidden shrink-0 w-52 xl:block" aria-label="On this page"><nav class="docs-toc sticky top-24" aria-label="On this page"><div class="font-mono mb-2 text-text-muted text-xs tracking-[0.2em] uppercase">On this page</div><ul class="space-y-1.5"><li><a href="#requirements" class="docs-toc-link">Requirements</a></li><li class="ps-3"><a href="#tools" class="docs-toc-link text-xs">Tools</a></li></ul></nav></aside></div></div></main><footer role="contentinfo" class="border-border border-t mt-24" data-animate><div class="border-b border-border"><div class="max-w-7xl mx-auto px-6 py-10"><div class="flex flex-col gap-6 items-start justify-between md:flex-row md:items-center"><div class="max-w-md"><h2 class="font-semibold text-lg text-text-primary">LarsArtmann Newsletter</h2><p class="mt-1 text-sm text-text-muted">Major releases and new open-source projects across all LarsArtmann work. No spam, unsubscribe anytime.</p></div><form id="newsletter-form" action="https://buttondown.email/api/emails/embed-subscribe/larsartmann" method="POST" target="popupwindow" class="flex gap-3 items-center md:w-auto w-full"><input type="email" name="email" required placeholder="you@e